This distribution provides CPU-only inference assets and/or an ONNX-converted
model for Korean PII detection and redaction.

Model traceability (upstream references):
- NER model: Leo97/KoELECTRA-small-v3-modu-ner (fine-tuned from monologg/koelectra-small-v3-discriminator)
- Reference implementation / model directory: skan0779/korean-pii (models directory)

The ONNX artifact is a format conversion and CPU-oriented optimization intended
to improve inference runtime only; no functional change is intended compared to
the upstream model behavior.

